From: lichenggang <lichenggang@uniontech.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 18:05:00 +0800
Subject: quirks: extend the ThinkBook G7+/G6+ pressure pad quirks to 16" models

The ThinkBook 14 G7+ ASP, 14 G6+ IMH and 14 G7+ IAH entries match on an
exact DMI product version (pvrThinkBook14G7+IAH and friends), so the
corresponding 16" machines are not covered and their touchpad stays
unusable: the firmware reports pressure as contact size, libinput then
treats every touch as a huge contact and discards it, leaving the pad
able to click but not to move the pointer.

Upstream fixed this in 8fe6cc93 ("quirks: modify touchpad quirk for
ThinkBook G7+") by widening the match to pvrThinkBook*G7+IAH,
pvrThinkBook*G7+ASP and pvrThinkBook*G6+IMH, which covers the 14" and
16" variants with one entry.

Backport that change. The wildcard still requires the exact "G7+IAH" /
"G7+ASP" / "G6+IMH" suffix, so unrelated ThinkBook and ThinkPad models
are not affected.

Ref: https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/libinput/libinput/-/commit/8fe6cc93
Forwarded: not-needed (backport of 8fe6cc93)
Signed-off-by: lichenggang <lichenggang@uniontech.com>
---
 quirks/50-system-lenovo.quirks | 18 +++++++++---------
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

diff --git a/quirks/50-system-lenovo.quirks b/quirks/50-system-lenovo.quirks
index c7826f8..aba8ac6 100644
@@ -382,18 +382,18 @@
 MatchDMIModalias=dmi:*svnLENOVO:*
 AttrKeyboardIntegration=internal
 
-# Some ThinkBook 14 G7+ ASP models come with pressure pads that were not
+# Some ThinkBook 14/16 G7+ ASP models come with pressure pads that were not
 # correctly declared as such.
-[Lenovo ThinkBook 14 G7+ ASP touchpad]
+[Lenovo ThinkBook G7+ ASP touchpad]
 MatchName=*GXTP5100*
-MatchDMIModalias=dmi:*svnLENOVO:*pvrThinkBook14G7+ASP*:*
+MatchDMIModalias=dmi:*svnLENOVO:*pvrThinkBook*G7+ASP*:*
 MatchUdevType=touchpad
 ModelPressurePad=1
 
-# The ThinkBook 14 G6+ IMH also has a similar issue as the G7+ mentioned above.
-[Lenovo ThinkBook 14 G6+ IMH]
+# The ThinkBook 14/16 G6+ IMH also has a similar issue as the G7+ mentioned above.
+[Lenovo ThinkBook G6+ IMH]
 MatchName=*GXTP5100*
-MatchDMIModalias=dmi:*svnLENOVO:*pvrThinkBook14G6+IMH*:*
+MatchDMIModalias=dmi:*svnLENOVO:*pvrThinkBook*G6+IMH*:*
 MatchUdevType=touchpad
 ModelPressurePad=1
 
@@ -411,10 +411,10 @@
 MatchUdevType=touchpad
 ModelPressurePad=1
 
-# The ThinkBook 14 G7+ IAH also has a similar issue as the ASP mentioned above.
-[Lenovo ThinkBook 14 G7+ IAH touchpad]
+# The ThinkBook 14/16 G7+ IAH also has a similar issue as the ASP mentioned above.
+[Lenovo ThinkBook G7+ IAH touchpad]
 MatchName=*GXTP5100*
-MatchDMIModalias=dmi:*svnLENOVO:*pvrThinkBook14G7+IAH*:*
+MatchDMIModalias=dmi:*svnLENOVO:*pvrThinkBook*G7+IAH*:*
 MatchUdevType=touchpad
 ModelPressurePad=1
 
